{"id":"pc13","classe":"PC","chap":13,"titre":"Liaison métal-ligand et catalyse homogène","exos":[{"n":1,"titre":"Nombre d'oxydation et décompte électronique","diff":1,"enonce":"<p class=\"q\">Méthode ionique : ligands X comptés comme anions donneurs de 2 électrons, ligands L neutres (2 électrons), <span class=\"m\"><sup>5</sup></span>-C<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub><sup>−</sup></span> : 6 électrons. Donner le n.o. du métal, sa configuration <span class=\"m\">d<sup>n</sup></span> et le nombre total d'électrons.</p><div class=\"cols\"> <ul class=\"en\"><li><span class=\"num\">1</span> [Fe(<span class=\"m\"><sup>5</sup></span>-C<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>)<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>] (ferrocène)</li><li><span class=\"num\">2</span> [Pd(C<span class=\"m\"><sub>6</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>)Br(PPh<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span>)<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>]</li><li><span class=\"num\">3</span> [Cr(CO)<span class=\"m\"><sub>6</sub></span>]</li><li><span class=\"num\">4</span> [Pd(PPh<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span>)<span class=\"m\"><sub>4</sub></span>]</li><li><span class=\"num\">5</span> [Mn(CO)<span class=\"m\"><sub>6</sub></span>]<span class=\"m\"><sup>+</sup></span></li><li><span class=\"num\">6</span> [Ti(<span class=\"m\"><sup>5</sup></span>-C<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>5</sub></span>)<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>(Cl)<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>]</li><li><span class=\"num\">7</span> [Pt(Cl)<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span>(C<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>4</sub></span>)]<span class=\"m\"><sup>−</sup></span> (sel de Zeise)</li><li><span class=\"num\">8</span> [Fe(CO)<span class=\"m\"><sub>4</sub></span>(C<span class=\"m\"><sub>2</sub></span>H<span class=\"m\"><sub>4</sub></span>)]</li><li><span class=\"num\">9</span> [Co(NH<span class=\"m\"><sub>3